<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\crows.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "ネジの壊れたロボット.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署外観夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Today the police station looked very different.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was crows. Dozens of crows were surrounding this police station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could the smell of death be coming from here, or something?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署受付.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
At the police station, <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE> was waiting.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="しか">scolded</STYLE> for not answering the phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="しか">scolded</STYLE> while being held tight. I was <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="しか">scolded</STYLE> by <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>, who was crying.<PG>
But why was that?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The feeling that I was being scolded didn't sink in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though I knew the reason I was being scolded, the reason <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE> was crying, and also the reason I was being held.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My own heart seemed to be floating somewhere up in the air.<PG>
Had <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE> really died?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yesterday morning, we had exchanged greetings as usual and headed off to school, to work.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet the next time we meet, even if I'm told he's a flayed body―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="おび">frightened</STYLE> and trembling, kept apologizing to me and <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE> said nothing. Neither blaming her, nor comforting her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Perhaps it was just my imagination, but <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>'s eyes even seemed to look at <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> with <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="あわ">pity</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"You're </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">-san, right? Could you go up to the second floor?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
And <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE>, accompanied by a different officer, headed for the stairs without saying a word.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was it "questioning as a murder suspect"?<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I called her name, <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> stopped for an instant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, without even turning toward me, she started up the stairs right away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> didn't kill <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It must be some kind of mistake...<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"And, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, I'd like </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> to come down to the basement."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Understood."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A reply so dry and calm it surprised even me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whether it's a hospital or the police, a basement doesn't give a very good impression.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE> seemed to have just arrived now, too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"They said to come down to the basement for a bit. I'll be back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"The basement...!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\霊安室表札.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "C" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
Where the detective called <STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> stopped was in front of the room with this nameplate.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Ummm... that is... For the identification... the remains, you see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE>, perhaps finding it hard to say, explained in a low mumble that was hard to catch.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, he was telling me to confirm <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>'s body.<PG>
A flayed body, even if it's <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>, is not something I want to see.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Rather, because it's <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>, I don't want to see it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the reason I came here was to make <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE>'s innocence clear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If, by identifying the body, there might be a clue that could prove it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the moment I decided to head here with <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE>, I had been prepared.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"You mean you'll let me see </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Well, that's so, but... um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">do you know the state the body is in...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"The skin stripped from the whole body, a corpse too wretched to look at, is what I've heard."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Well... yeah... But, though it's strange for me to say it, I'd rather not recommend it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Your mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> already looked at it for us, anyway..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"I'm allowed to see him, aren't I?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Then, this way..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\献花台.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A small, dim room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Funeral flowers and a blank <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="いはい">memorial tablet</STYLE> had been set out, and the smell of incense hung thick in the air.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Were the crows out front sniffing out the smell of death that this incense should have covered up?<PG>
I couldn't make out any smell of death like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only the smell of incense, and of somehow inorganic concrete―though in truth it was organic―was all I could make out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\皮剥ぎ死体布.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
In the center of the room, a platform like a bed without a mattress.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On top of it, a 'something' with a white cloth draped over it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That something―a little of something reddish-black was sticking out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Under this is <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\献花台.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="7">"You only need to check just a little. If you can tell whether it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">your dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> or not, tell me so. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">If you can't tell... it can't be helped..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Then... I'm taking the cloth off."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\皮剥ぎ死体布.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> put his hand on the edge of the cloth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Please wait..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hm? Going to stop after all? That's fine by me, even so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"No... please let me be the one to take off the cloth..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I moved my stalled feet toward the platform.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"All right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> took one step back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I took hold of the cloth, and then slowly lifted it up.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\黒塗り.gal" "WAIT" "20" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "堕ちる.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\皮剥ぎ死体1.gal" "NORMAL" "4" "300" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The one sleeping there was, unmistakably, <STYLE ID="3">my dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Other people might not be able to tell, but, still, it's without a doubt <STYLE ID="3">my dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even changed beyond recognition like this, I would never mistake him.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\皮剥ぎ死体2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "5!" "200" "540" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"I thought it would be worse, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">I can clearly tell, it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I-I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the eyes of an ordinary person, it must be an extremely gruesome body.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, feelings like fear or disgust didn't well up in me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Why... even though the skin was stripped off... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">are the eyes gone too?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\皮剥ぎ死体3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "4" "300" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"That's, well... the direct cause of death was that he bled to death from crows pecking at him... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">The crows, you see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If this were someone else, I would probably have feelings like these.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
'What a horrible lump of flesh. 
{PAUSE ""}
So people, when you skin them and crows peck at them a little, can turn into something this grotesque and ugly, and hideous. 
{PAUSE ""}
Truly disgusting, unpleasant, I don't even want to look.'<PG>
But, what if it were someone close to me, someone I loved dearly?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I gazed at <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>'s face once more.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\怖い効果音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\皮剥ぎ死体全体.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "12" "7000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n500\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\皮剥ぎ死体ノーマル.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Once I knew it was <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE> and looked at his face, not the <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="みじん">slightest</STYLE> bit of the unpleasant feelings from before welled up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Simply... 
{PAUSE ""}
simply, simply, 
{PAUSE ""}
simply, simply empty.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a feeling of <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="くう">emptiness</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no fear or revulsion―not even that, only a hollow, vacant feeling.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
